<title>USA: Pulitzer Publishing Co Q3 net higher.</title>
<headline>Pulitzer Publishing Co Q3 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter    Nine Months</p>
<p>				   1996	1995	1996	1995</p>
<p>OPERATING REVENUES - NET:</p>
<p>Publishing:</p>
<p>     Advertising	   $53,428  $39,629  $135,882  $117,940</p>
<p>     Circulation	    21,910   18,468    59,704    56,057</p>
<p>     Other		     9,479    7,223    23,941    21,981</p>
<p>	Total Publishing    84,817   65,320   219,527   195,978</p>
