<p>	  (In thousands, except earnings per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include the third quarter operations of Scripps League Newspapers Inc acquired on July 1, 1996.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 includes $2.2 million of depreciation and amortization and $3.3 million of net interest charges related to this acquisition which had a $3.7 million negative after-tax effect on earnings for the quarter.</p>
<p>Average shares and per share amounts restated for 4-four-3 stock split payable November 1, 1996.</p>
